<title>USA: U.S. Robotics holders approve 3Com merger.</title>
<headline>U.S. Robotics holders approve 3Com merger.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Robotics Corp said Wednesday its shareholders approved its merger with 3Com Corp with 58 percent voting in favor of the deal.</p>
<p>During a meeting of shareholders here, U.S. Robotics also said 3Com stockholders have cleared the deal.</p>
<p>The deal was valued at $8.5 billion and was expected to close Thursday, June 12, the company said.</p>
<p>Under terms of the agreement, U.S. Robotics shareholders receive 1.75 shares of 3Com for each U.S. Robotics share. U.S. Robotics had 107.5 million shares outstanding including vested options.</p>
<p>	   -- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
